## 1. Project Context

This software, EpicEvents CRM, is developed as part of **Project 12** of the **Python Application Developer** training path at OpenClassrooms. It represents a portfolio piece demonstrating skills in:

- Python development
- CLI application development with Textual
- MVC architecture implementation
- JWT authentication with RSA keys
- RBAC permission systems
- MySQL database integration with SQLAlchemy
- Alembic migrations

